{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Combat｜近战判定流程\n结构见 [[GGYGO_结构_Combat.canvas|结构图]]；伤害后续见 [[AbilitySystem/GGYGO_流程_伤害结算.canvas]]。\n认证窗口 → 原身份查询／去重／订阅 → GA 构造并提交 GE/Cue → 按原资源清理。[[Combat/结构|接口与职责]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1710,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "open",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. 认证 Montage Hit 窗口事实 → Owned 开窗。\nCombo 先 ReleaseTraceWindow(Original)，以 Step.TraceShape＋原 Mesh 开窗。\nBoss 用 RootTip；原窗 Active 时重复 Begin 保去重，Inactive 才释放重开。\nTryOpenOwnedTraceWindow → SubscribeWindowHit → token。\n回调捕/核 Original、声明、原 Task/Trace、窗口。\n失败由原 GA 处理，不接管 Legacy。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "baseline",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. ReadTraceShapeFrame 先读所有链控制点，核原 Mesh/点/拓扑及整窗预算。\n\n首帧共同保存 PreviousPoints，不 Sweep；后续帧才以上帧→本帧坐标查询，避免跨窗口虚假命中。",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "sweep",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. 按前/本帧最大段长÷世界半径向上取整，至少1段。\n各段含端点的 Sweep 共用 MaxTraceSegments+1 预算。\nPerformTrace → SweepMultiByChannel，回填物材。\n失效/超预算关原窗；帧间直线近似，大角度旋转有误差。",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "dedupe",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. 全链共用 HitActorsThisWindow 弱引用去重。\nOwned 快照订阅 → callback(OriginalWindow, Actor, Hit)。\n外调前核原窗/token/资源，外调后复核；GA 另核原 Activation/来源。\nB 回调关 B 开 C → 停 B 分发/扫掠/回写；C 首 Tick 建基线。\nLegacy 广播 OnMeleeHit；Combo/Boss 用 Owned。",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "ge",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. GA 核原身份/Trace/窗口/权威。\n同次 HitResult＋原 Avatar 命中时位置 → BuildHitEffectPayload。\nGA 配置数值并提交 GE/Cue，GAS 结算。\nCombo 显式无GE可Cue；必需GE/Builder失败 → RequestAbilityEnd(Original, true, true)。\nBoss 要求GE/Spec，构造失败仅拒绝该 hit。\n有效 GE 免疫/拒绝仍按碰撞 Cue 策略。",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 918,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "close",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "6. 匹配声明的 HitWindowEnd/换段/原终止 → GA 清自己的原窗。\nCombo ReleaseTraceWindow；Boss CloseOriginalTraceWindow。\n先脱成员 → 退原token → 关原H；旧身份不清后继。\nCleanupAbilityResourcesForTermination(Context) 核原批次并归还自身其他资源。\n组件 Deactivate/OnUnregister/EndPlay/内部失败 → CloseCurrentTraceWindow。\n停 Tick、清 Shape/借用资源/基线/去重；Legacy End 仅管 Legacy。",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 972,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "1"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "open",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "baseline",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Owned 成功取得原窗口"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "baseline",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "sweep",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "基线有效"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "sweep",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "dedupe",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "获得命中候选"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "dedupe",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "ge",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "原窗口/token → Combo/Boss 命中核验"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "fromNode": "ge",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "close",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "窗口结束／原GA终止 → 清原资源"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6",
      "fromNode": "dedupe",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "sweep",
      "toSide": "right",
      "label": "原窗口仍活动才继续；失效退出"
    }
  ]
}
